      "writtenOn": "2023-08-25T17:28:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I was a little torn about whether or not to just pass the layer-space coordinates in to the blur function or if it would make more sense to keep it relative to the source image.\n\nIt\u0027s a little bit of a wash right now because the source image is a special image and its (0,0) is not actually the true origin of the pixel data. Once FilterResult processes images directly, then implementors of the callback won\u0027t have to worry about also accounting for the special image\u0027s subset\u0027s offset and I think this offsetting will be convenient for everyone involved.",
